<section aria-label="Related historical guide"><h2>Historical context: what is a gaucho?</h2><p>The literary dimension of <em>gaucho meaning</em> becomes clearer when rural song is distinguished from the written gauchesque genre. For readers asking <em>what is a gaucho</em>, our <a href="/en/what-is-a-gaucho/">guide to gaucho history and Martín Fierro</a> provides the social background.</p></section>
